  "description": "Where Light Becomes Motion. Where Civilization Comes Alive.\n\nFrom structure came life.\n\nAfter the systems were built, Mars evolved. Cities rose. Energy ignited. Light began to flow across the surface — forming a new world alive with movement, culture, and expression. From this emergence, the Mars Lumina was created.\n\nMars Lumina represents the living future of Mars — bold, electric, and unapologetically expressive. Its aero carbon design is built for speed, efficiency, and cutting-edge performance, slicing through wind with precision while maintaining control and stability.\n\nThe striking neon yellow and black contrast, layered with graffiti-inspired elements, reflects the pulse of a futuristic city — raw energy, individuality, and the spirit of a new generation.\n\nFast, aggressive, and visually unapologetic, Mars Lumina is made for riders who don’t just follow the road — they define it.\n\nMars Lumina is not just a bike.\n\nIt is the light of a new world in motion.\n\nThe new Voodoo Mars Lumina is an aero bike for modern cycling. From the clean looks provided by the fully internal routing; to 32mm tire clearance for better rolling resistance and extra comfort; UDH to provide compatibility with the most modern drivetrains; and a T47 BB shell for the convenience of home mechanics.\n\nIn scientific terms, the word lumina refers to cavities or open spaces, usually in conduct-like organs. We designed Mars Lumina to help you ride through the wind with less effort. To make you feel you found a lumina in the air that makes you reach that extra speed we love to feel while riding.",
